    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1325">

                <pb facs="1585" n="1387" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1387"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 (Potsdam)/7–3145</note>
                <head>No. 1325<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Report by the Economic
                    Subcommittee</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1325-f1"/>]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-08-01">August 1, 1945</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Third Report of the Economic
                        Subcommittee to the Foreign Ministers</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>The Soviet representatives reported that they were not yet in a position further
                    to discuss the matter of oil supplies from the East.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1325-f2"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
